    {
      "title": "USDC Blocklist Can Permanently Lock All Reserve Funds With No Emergency Escape",
      "description": "If USDC adds the reserve contract address to its blocklist (as it has done with Tornado Cash-linked addresses), all fiat transfers fail permanently. There is no emergency withdrawal mechanism, fallback token support, or migration capability. All DSU would become irredeemable. The reserve has no owner-callable emergency function to rescue assets or migrate to a different fiat token. Recommendation: add owner-callable emergency migration function and consider supporting multiple fiat tokens.",
